{"title": "I’ve waited a long time for the Boox Picco, and I’m not disappointed", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/10/adorably-tiny-boox-picco-e-reader-does-not-disappoint/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/11/Boox-Picco-13.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At around $100, the Boox Picco offers one of the most portable e-reader experiences you can get. You add MagSafe-like capability with a refreshingly simple UI, and you have a delightful way to read, literally wherever you are.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/10/adorably-tiny-boox-picco-e-reader-does-not-disappoint/#more-736276\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-10T11:15:00+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-11T17:50:04.285369+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
{"title": "Android 17 QPR2 November update rolling out with 33 Pixel fixes", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/10/android-17-qpr2-november-pixel-update/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/09/Pixel-9-Pro-and-11-Pro-family-cameras.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Android 17 QPR2 is rolling out a month early with the <a href=\"https://9to5google.com/?p=736296\">November 2026 Feature Drop</a> and security patch. The update is available for the Pixel 6a, 7, 7 Pro, 7a, Tablet, Fold, 8, 8 Pro, 8a, 9, 9 Pro, 9 Pro XL, 9 Pro Fold, 9a, 10, 10 Pro, 10 Pro XL, 10a, 11, 11 Pro, 11 Pro XL, and 11 Pro Fold.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">There are Pixel fixes across Apps, Audio, Battery & Charging, Bluetooth, Camera, Connectivity, Display & Graphics, Framework, Performance, Sensors, System, Telephony, and User Interface.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/10/android-17-qpr2-november-pixel-update/#more-734930\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-10T11:00:00+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-11T17:50:04.285369+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
