{"title": "Google Fi brings back network switching with ‘secondary’ partner, expands W+ beyond Pixel", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/10/google-fi-network-switching/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/11/Google-Fi-Wireless-cover.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Google Fi Wireless is rolling out a big update today with the return of network switching thanks to a “secondary” partner.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/10/google-fi-network-switching/#more-736032\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-10T08:30:00+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-11T17:50:04.285369+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
{"title": "Save serious money with RedPocket’s Black Friday plans that start at $5 a month", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/10/save-serious-money-with-redpockets-black-friday-plans-that-start-at-5-a-month-sponsored/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/11/00947cc8ee4c3fe022e46888fd9a63f8_abt-us-mob.webp?w=1536\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You’re not going to believe this, but there’s one part of your life that’s not actually getting more expensive. If you <a href=\"https://www.redpocket.com/shop?utm_source=9to5&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=9to5_article\" rel=\"sponsored nofollow\">switch to RedPocket Mobile</a> during its Black Friday sale, you can ditch your costly carrier and get a plan that starts at $5 per month. It’s not too good to be true: RedPocket has been around for 20 years, and unlike most MVNOs, it’s independently owned and operated. That gives it the ability to offer you real network choice when you sign up for a new plan (we’ll explain more later), and keeps your costs low. Really low.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/10/save-serious-money-with-redpockets-black-friday-plans-that-start-at-5-a-month-sponsored/#more-735678\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-10T08:24:50+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-11T17:50:04.285369+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
